Z||000026||Joe4x4||02-28-2001||05:36 AM||||OK....here is the solution to this OLD puzzle. I too  had this in school and many <BR>days of trying to figure it out , with no luck with the LAST LINE.<P>I did find the solution in a old riddle book<BR>( DO NOT GET MAD AT ME ).<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Puzzle_3_house,3_bill........Cliff_Pennock.jpg"> <P>Yes ...this the SOLUTION, in the wording of this puzzle it says that YOU CAN`T CROSS OVER<BR>LINES but it did not say anything about DIGGING UNDER.<P>Now we can put this old puzzle to sleep.<BR>If you are like me this puzzle drove me nuts when I was a young pup in school.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Fiero got fire<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/exp.gif">          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/animated_cat.gif"> ||||reg||1
